1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
Sesame cooks soup in the kitchen hut.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,500
Smoke comes from the pot.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,500
More smoke comes.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,500
Sesame covers his mouth and runs.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,500
He shouts, Fire! Run!

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,500
Magpie flies high and shouts too.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,500
Friends run out.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,500
They run to the river bay.

9
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,500
Friends shout, Don't go back!

10
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:49,500
People are safe first.

11
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:54,500
They count. One, two, three, four, five.

12
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:59,500
All are safe. We are safe!
